(1849702, 255268, 18552, '<td valign="top">Cool rats. I worked at a cannery one summer while in college and there were many rats on the loading dock. They were a lot meaner than these ones appear to be. Are these tame or feral rats - the one with it''s face showing actually looks kind of friendly!</td>', 'Cool rats. I worked at a cannery one summer while in college and there were many rats on the loading dock. They were a lot meaner than these ones appear to be. Are these tame or feral rats - the one with it''s face showing actually looks kind of friendly!', '2005-11-09 05:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
