(1851659, 254357, 33515, '<td valign="top">The garbage (at least the man made) is hard to pick out. The depth of field could have been deeper and the horizon is tilted way to the left. I''m not trying to pick, I really like the photo and am trying to point out some things that keep me from voting higher. Best of luck.</td>', 'The garbage (at least the man made) is hard to pick out. The depth of field could have been deeper and the horizon is tilted way to the left. I''m not trying to pick, I really like the photo and am trying to point out some things that keep me from voting higher. Best of luck.', '2005-11-09 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
