(1851747, 254010, 24789, '<td valign="top">This is so piss poor, shes someones daughter, sister, wife maybe,  you dont know her story, her life, her situation, to judge her as garbage, and "Society''s Rot"  is bullshit but to whore out her image in an attempt for a lousy dpc ribbon, makes you no better than her pimp, your both using her.</td>', 'This is so piss poor, shes someones daughter, sister, wife maybe,  you dont know her story, her life, her situation, to judge her as garbage, and "Society''s Rot"  is bullshit but to whore out her image in an attempt for a lousy dpc ribbon, makes you no better than her pimp, your both using her.', '2005-11-09 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851751, 255590, 32644, '<td valign="top">I hope this child is not your garbage shot. It''s a cute portrait and would be better in focus.</td>', 'I hope this child is not your garbage shot. It''s a cute portrait and would be better in focus.', '2005-11-09 15:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851758, 255157, 45790, '<td valign="top">Humorous photo, perhaps a bit too sharp and oversaturated with lots of blown highlights. I wonder how long that car has been sitting there?<br/></td>', 'Humorous photo, perhaps a bit too sharp and oversaturated with lots of blown highlights. I wonder how long that car has been sitting there?', '2005-11-09 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851759, 255031, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is funny but needs more light to offset the relections. A daytime shot might be better.</td>', 'This is funny but needs more light to offset the relections. A daytime shot might be better.', '2005-11-09 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851764, 254016, 32644, '<td valign="top">Sory, I don''t get this one. It is too contrasty to see very clearly.</td>', 'Sory, I don''t get this one. It is too contrasty to see very clearly.', '2005-11-09 15:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851768, 255208, 45790, '<td valign="top">Yum, I''m hungry! Like the toilet paper roll and used Kleenex for the (I guess) table napkin. High score for being on topic, yet humorously leaving a message.<br/></td>', 'Yum, I''m hungry! Like the toilet paper roll and used Kleenex for the (I guess) table napkin. High score for being on topic, yet humorously leaving a message.', '2005-11-09 15:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
