(1851781, 255380, 45790, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing really wrong with this, and it is creative, but I just don''t like it. Purely subjective judgement.</td>', 'There''s nothing really wrong with this, and it is creative, but I just don''t like it. Purely subjective judgement.', '2005-11-09 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851789, 254010, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think this has a good photojournalistic quality about it... I''d reduce the yellow some and crop in closer, maybe just a bit to the left of the big lamppost, and take some off the top.  I think you''ll probaby take a big hit on your choice of title but that''s neither here nor there.  I think it''s rather telling of society''s judgment of prostitution.  Good, thought-provoking image.</td>', 'I think this has a good photojournalistic quality about it... I''d reduce the yellow some and crop in closer, maybe just a bit to the left of the big lamppost, and take some off the top.  I think you''ll probaby take a big hit on your choice of title but that''s neither here nor there.  I think it''s rather telling of society''s judgment of prostitution.  Good, thought-provoking image.', '2005-11-09 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
