(1851988, 255106, 25655, '<td valign="top">It''s such a sad photo. It feels so lonely. even neglect.<br/>A place I will most probably not stop to look at. Quite the opposite - I will hurry up to pass what would seem to me like a haunted place. <br/>Those branches however make me feel that this fountain is quite hidden from the main road so maybe I don''t have to hurry.<br/> <br/>I like the colors but they don''t make me feel comfortable. The slow motion of the water on the right add to the ghostly feel. And most of all, the broken heart shape at the "legs" of the fountain just pull my eyes back to the little plastic bottle.<br/> <br/>I suppose I am a lot more philosophycal then you actually ment this photo to be... But it works great for the challenge. <br/>I really hope this one is not too easy to miss...</td>', 'It''s such a sad photo. It feels so lonely. even neglect.A place I will most probably not stop to look at. Quite the opposite - I will hurry up to pass what would seem to me like a haunted place. Those branches however make me feel that this fountain is quite hidden from the main road so maybe I don''t have to hurry. I like the colors but they don''t make me feel comfortable. The slow motion of the water on the right add to the ghostly feel. And most of all, the broken heart shape at the "legs" of the fountain just pull my eyes back to the little plastic bottle. I suppose I am a lot more philosophycal then you actually ment this photo to be... But it works great for the challenge. I really hope this one is not too easy to miss...', '2005-11-09 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
