(1852721, 252830, 46177, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea just lacked the appeal I think it may have had if more of the rusted horse shoes were visible.  The box lacks texture and interest where as the horse shoes would have been more interesting as the focus of the shot in my opinion.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea just lacked the appeal I think it may have had if more of the rusted horse shoes were visible.  The box lacks texture and interest where as the horse shoes would have been more interesting as the focus of the shot in my opinion.', '2005-11-09 20:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852726, 254938, 46177, '<td valign="top">The crop here doesn''t appeal to me as it looks like just a line of garbage on an otherwise unintereting back ground.  Maybe if there was more colour or if the angle were different it would have had more of an impact.</td>', 'The crop here doesn''t appeal to me as it looks like just a line of garbage on an otherwise unintereting back ground.  Maybe if there was more colour or if the angle were different it would have had more of an impact.', '2005-11-09 20:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852729, 254285, 46177, '<td valign="top">To me this lacks appeal for a number of reasons, the crop showing the uninteresting background and the lack of real focus on the garbage recepticle.  The colour choices seem bland as well.</td>', 'To me this lacks appeal for a number of reasons, the crop showing the uninteresting background and the lack of real focus on the garbage recepticle.  The colour choices seem bland as well.', '2005-11-09 20:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852732, 255309, 46177, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this does not really meet the challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion this does not really meet the challenge.', '2005-11-09 20:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852737, 254108, 46177, '<td valign="top">I like the curve and the colours of the re bar but am just not sure it clearly meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the curve and the colours of the re bar but am just not sure it clearly meets the challenge.', '2005-11-09 20:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852739, 255528, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but I am not sure it clearly meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice colours but I am not sure it clearly meets the challenge.', '2005-11-09 20:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852751, 255501, 46177, '<td valign="top">The sky is very nice in this shot but the foreground with the garbage just doesn''t work for me I would have liked it if it were lighter and I could more clearly make out the grapette, I feel there is not enough contrast, maybe by highligting the lights and darkening the darks it would have brought it to life.</td>', 'The sky is very nice in this shot but the foreground with the garbage just doesn''t work for me I would have liked it if it were lighter and I could more clearly make out the grapette, I feel there is not enough contrast, maybe by highligting the lights and darkening the darks it would have brought it to life.', '2005-11-09 20:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852754, 254226, 46177, '<td valign="top">Other than the title I am not sure this meets the challenge.</td>', 'Other than the title I am not sure this meets the challenge.', '2005-11-09 20:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852761, 254086, 46177, '<td valign="top">This shot is different however I found it lacked to much focus, nothing really to look at and no colours jump out, it is definately not a bad shot just lacked the punch I feel you need for a winning shot.</td>', 'This shot is different however I found it lacked to much focus, nothing really to look at and no colours jump out, it is definately not a bad shot just lacked the punch I feel you need for a winning shot.', '2005-11-09 20:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852763, 255447, 47365, '<td valign="top">image is grainy, and the lighting isn''t very nice.  i like the composition though.</td>', 'image is grainy, and the lighting isn''t very nice.  i like the composition though.', '2005-11-09 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852765, 255518, 47365, '<td valign="top">very underexposed.  a nice subject, but not well done.</td>', 'very underexposed.  a nice subject, but not well done.', '2005-11-09 20:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852769, 255214, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo and I really like the depth of field used.  It just lacks the appeal of a winning photo for me in that it isn''t really interesting, I think the crop is what makes it not work for me.  Also I have to say alot of smokers might be insulted by your title, lots of people have bad habits and don''t like to be called trashy.  Hope thats not to nit picky for you. 5</td>', 'Very clear photo and I really like the depth of field used.  It just lacks the appeal of a winning photo for me in that it isn''t really interesting, I think the crop is what makes it not work for me.  Also I have to say alot of smokers might be insulted by your title, lots of people have bad habits and don''t like to be called trashy.  Hope thats not to nit picky for you. 5', '2005-11-09 20:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852772, 255273, 47365, '<td valign="top">don''t really like the foreground blurring, and the sky is quite overexposed (which is probably unavoidable).  i don''t understand the title, either.  why is your mother in a garbage can?</td>', 'don''t really like the foreground blurring, and the sky is quite overexposed (which is probably unavoidable).  i don''t understand the title, either.  why is your mother in a garbage can?', '2005-11-09 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852774, 253824, 46177, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this in colour or even with some nice selective desat, as its stands the image is a bit to flat for my taste.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this in colour or even with some nice selective desat, as its stands the image is a bit to flat for my taste.', '2005-11-09 20:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852778, 252591, 46177, '<td valign="top">I like the colour here and the contrast with the grapes, I just feel it is not an interesting enough shot to have the impact needed for people to place it in the top 10.</td>', 'I like the colour here and the contrast with the grapes, I just feel it is not an interesting enough shot to have the impact needed for people to place it in the top 10.', '2005-11-09 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852779, 255245, 47365, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  it''s hard to tell that the ant is there at all, unfortunately.  maybe it would have been better on a whiter floor, but overall a cool idea.  nice reflections too.</td>', 'nice shot.  it''s hard to tell that the ant is there at all, unfortunately.  maybe it would have been better on a whiter floor, but overall a cool idea.  nice reflections too.', '2005-11-09 20:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852782, 255483, 46177, '<td valign="top">You obviously put thought into this and it is original however for me it just lacks appeal, I think it is to dark all round and not enough interest or colour in the garbage itself, still you did have a good idea and that is the hard part.</td>', 'You obviously put thought into this and it is original however for me it just lacks appeal, I think it is to dark all round and not enough interest or colour in the garbage itself, still you did have a good idea and that is the hard part.', '2005-11-09 20:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852786, 255448, 46177, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to understand the title as I missed the burger king sign at first.  You think it would be obvious but in my opinion the crop just didn''t let you focus on it enough to give the impact I think you wanted.  Maybe it could have been larger or brighter in that area.</td>', 'It took me a minute to understand the title as I missed the burger king sign at first.  You think it would be obvious but in my opinion the crop just didn''t let you focus on it enough to give the impact I think you wanted.  Maybe it could have been larger or brighter in that area.', '2005-11-09 20:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852874, 252866, 34013, '<td valign="top">i love squirrels!! :)</td>', 'i love squirrels!! :)', '2005-11-09 21:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852895, 254568, 46177, '<td valign="top">This really stands out, its so grungy and to the point that it works perfectly. I really like the use of space to enhance the cigarettes.</td>', 'This really stands out, its so grungy and to the point that it works perfectly. I really like the use of space to enhance the cigarettes.', '2005-11-09 21:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852900, 255483, 26464, '<td valign="top">ohhh great concept, what''s with the little dots around the cloud though? takes a way a bit.. but 7 for originality<br/></td>', 'ohhh great concept, what''s with the little dots around the cloud though? takes a way a bit.. but 7 for originality', '2005-11-09 21:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852901, 254633, 46177, '<td valign="top">The colour are great and so is the use of the framing to bring it all out.  Its busy but still has a nice focal point that draws you into the photo.  Really enjoyed your image.</td>', 'The colour are great and so is the use of the framing to bring it all out.  Its busy but still has a nice focal point that draws you into the photo.  Really enjoyed your image.', '2005-11-09 21:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
