(1852946, 254693, 45790, '<td valign="top">Not to my taste, sorry.Oversaturated and too much contrast. The framing leaves me wondering what the subject is -- the ripped up pages or the woman?</td>', 'Not to my taste, sorry.Oversaturated and too much contrast. The framing leaves me wondering what the subject is -- the ripped up pages or the woman?', '2005-11-09 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
