(1852962, 255590, 45790, '<td valign="top">And what does this have do do with garbage? If he is staring at garbage and saying "Bleh" I''d like to see the garbage in the picture, maybe as a reflection in his eye.</td>', 'And what does this have do do with garbage? If he is staring at garbage and saying "Bleh" I''d like to see the garbage in the picture, maybe as a reflection in his eye.', '2005-11-09 21:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
