(1853325, 253103, 47365, '<td valign="top">looks a bit like a shot from a digital video camera in night vision mode.  doesn''t really turn my crank.</td>', 'looks a bit like a shot from a digital video camera in night vision mode.  doesn''t really turn my crank.', '2005-11-09 23:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
