(1853362, 254016, 47365, '<td valign="top">this photo is a bit bizarre and out of focus.  but i still like it -- a bit like a horror flick.  not sure why it''s all streaked vertically, but an interesting idea.</td>', 'this photo is a bit bizarre and out of focus.  but i still like it -- a bit like a horror flick.  not sure why it''s all streaked vertically, but an interesting idea.', '2005-11-09 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
