(1854443, 255590, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but I know, "Bleh" is difficult to capture!   :) Perhaps you were trying to convey the actual moment when she says it (thus, the blur), but the audience may not immediately appreciate that (lack of focus) at first glance.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the concept, but I know, "Bleh" is difficult to capture!   :) Perhaps you were trying to convey the actual moment when she says it (thus, the blur), but the audience may not immediately appreciate that (lack of focus) at first glance.  Good luck!', '2005-11-10 11:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854458, 255053, 36832, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought maybe this was entered in the wrong challenge until I read the title.  I think your photo would score higher if you were to capture the subject "in action" :)<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'At first glance, I thought maybe this was entered in the wrong challenge until I read the title.  I think your photo would score higher if you were to capture the subject "in action" :) Good luck!', '2005-11-10 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854475, 253318, 36832, '<td valign="top">This photo has such amazing potential for scoring high.  Normally, I would love pictures of clouds and mountains and hills, but (IMO) the photo of the dilapidated house/structure would have been more dramatic especially with different lighting.  I hope that doesn''t sound harsh...just trying to be constructive :)</td>', 'This photo has such amazing potential for scoring high.  Normally, I would love pictures of clouds and mountains and hills, but (IMO) the photo of the dilapidated house/structure would have been more dramatic especially with different lighting.  I hope that doesn''t sound harsh...just trying to be constructive :)', '2005-11-10 11:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854517, 253365, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of contrasting ideas--beautiful beach and trashy balloon.  I would have liked to have seen a closer view of the deflated balloon so that you wouldn''t have to tell us in the title, and you''d still have a beautiful shoreline background.  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the concept of contrasting ideas--beautiful beach and trashy balloon.  I would have liked to have seen a closer view of the deflated balloon so that you wouldn''t have to tell us in the title, and you''d still have a beautiful shoreline background.  :)  Good luck.', '2005-11-10 11:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
