(1856002, 253637, 45390, '<td valign="top">Hey... i had the same idea!!!! but didn´t realized it...I´m sure that your picture would have been better that mine... i like very much the very sharp banana and the shoes out of focus and the leaves give the picture a lovely touch!!!!    congratulations... my photo´s title was: dangerous garbage lol   10!!!!</td>', 'Hey... i had the same idea!!!! but didn´t realized it...I´m sure that your picture would have been better that mine... i like very much the very sharp banana and the shoes out of focus and the leaves give the picture a lovely touch!!!!    congratulations... my photo´s title was: dangerous garbage lol   10!!!!', '2005-11-10 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856051, 255518, 37875, '<td valign="top">cool mailbox!  the picture seems like it wanted different/bounced lighting, but i love how t-rex looks like he''s creeping up on the mailman!  also love the trees and clouds in the background...</td>', 'cool mailbox!  the picture seems like it wanted different/bounced lighting, but i love how t-rex looks like he''s creeping up on the mailman!  also love the trees and clouds in the background...', '2005-11-10 18:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
