(1856053, 253601, 37875, '<td valign="top">no, we''ve got septic waste tanks in california, too.  " )<br/>interesting composition with the twisted metal going up the center.  like the perforated bricks with their spotty effect, too.</td>', 'no, we''ve got septic waste tanks in california, too.  " )interesting composition with the twisted metal going up the center.  like the perforated bricks with their spotty effect, too.', '2005-11-10 18:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856055, 254673, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the leaves as a warm contrast to the cool blue tones.</td>', 'like the leaves as a warm contrast to the cool blue tones.', '2005-11-10 18:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856056, 254108, 37875, '<td valign="top">construction waste is always cool.  nicely composed, like the blues.</td>', 'construction waste is always cool.  nicely composed, like the blues.', '2005-11-10 18:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856057, 254423, 37875, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge subject.  the flowers look nice now, but give them a week or two...<br/>not so crazy about the selective desaturation effect for this, but i like the composition .  like hte lighting as well.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge subject.  the flowers look nice now, but give them a week or two...not so crazy about the selective desaturation effect for this, but i like the composition .  like hte lighting as well.', '2005-11-10 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856058, 254633, 37875, '<td valign="top">the orange looks oversaturated to my eye (in the thin band over the center wheel, and in the rust/pain marks on the salvage.)  groovy composition and nice lighting.</td>', 'the orange looks oversaturated to my eye (in the thin band over the center wheel, and in the rust/pain marks on the salvage.)  groovy composition and nice lighting.', '2005-11-10 18:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856059, 253995, 37875, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  wish the sign would have been more in focus, or more focus on the junk than mail section...</td>', 'cool idea.  wish the sign would have been more in focus, or more focus on the junk than mail section...', '2005-11-10 18:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856060, 255617, 37875, '<td valign="top">it would have been interesting for this challenge to see some of the discarded plastics...<br/>this photo is nicely composed, and i like the neutral colors.</td>', 'it would have been interesting for this challenge to see some of the discarded plastics...this photo is nicely composed, and i like the neutral colors.', '2005-11-10 18:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856062, 254158, 37875, '<td valign="top">ooh!  like the can very much, half buried in the leaves.  not so thrilled by the tone of brown for the monochrome, but i see where you''re going with it.</td>', 'ooh!  like the can very much, half buried in the leaves.  not so thrilled by the tone of brown for the monochrome, but i see where you''re going with it.', '2005-11-10 18:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856063, 254924, 37875, '<td valign="top">i wonder how this could have been shot to make the image more visually exciting?</td>', 'i wonder how this could have been shot to make the image more visually exciting?', '2005-11-10 18:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856064, 254760, 37875, '<td valign="top">poor car!<br/>like the dof, how the trees are blurred in the background.  the composition lacks visual interest in my eye, though.  i''d like to see other angles of the car, or closer shots emphasizing some of the rot...</td>', 'poor car!like the dof, how the trees are blurred in the background.  the composition lacks visual interest in my eye, though.  i''d like to see other angles of the car, or closer shots emphasizing some of the rot...', '2005-11-10 18:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856066, 255208, 37875, '<td valign="top">ha!  like the concept!  not so thrilled by the all white background...it dilutes the impact of the garbage plate in my eye (not as vivid as i''d like to see).</td>', 'ha!  like the concept!  not so thrilled by the all white background...it dilutes the impact of the garbage plate in my eye (not as vivid as i''d like to see).', '2005-11-10 18:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856067, 252710, 37875, '<td valign="top">this picture is not so effective being this dark, to my eye.  interesting lighting could really make this composition pop.</td>', 'this picture is not so effective being this dark, to my eye.  interesting lighting could really make this composition pop.', '2005-11-10 18:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856068, 255241, 37875, '<td valign="top">i would have liked to see this shot at more of an angle to the bin, cropping out the car.</td>', 'i would have liked to see this shot at more of an angle to the bin, cropping out the car.', '2005-11-10 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856069, 254538, 37875, '<td valign="top">i have to say, my eye is drawn to the tree reflection more than the surroundings in this picture.</td>', 'i have to say, my eye is drawn to the tree reflection more than the surroundings in this picture.', '2005-11-10 18:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856071, 255384, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice colors with the cup and leaves.  nicely composed, too.  i like this.</td>', 'nice colors with the cup and leaves.  nicely composed, too.  i like this.', '2005-11-10 18:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856073, 253582, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the lighting on the stones and bottlecap.  nicely composed.</td>', 'like the lighting on the stones and bottlecap.  nicely composed.', '2005-11-10 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856074, 253637, 37875, '<td valign="top">great idea!  nice dof and composition.  would have liked to see less harsh light so that the banana color can just pop out.</td>', 'great idea!  nice dof and composition.  would have liked to see less harsh light so that the banana color can just pop out.', '2005-11-10 18:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856075, 255499, 37875, '<td valign="top">ahh, chinatown.  if ever there was a great place to take a photo...<br/>i love the composition of this photo, and the action of your subject.  I''m not as thrilled by the color treatment, but this is a lovely candid/photojournalism shot.  nice capture!</td>', 'ahh, chinatown.  if ever there was a great place to take a photo...i love the composition of this photo, and the action of your subject.  I''m not as thrilled by the color treatment, but this is a lovely candid/photojournalism shot.  nice capture!', '2005-11-10 18:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856077, 255114, 37875, '<td valign="top">go squirrel, go!<br/>cute image of the squirrel leaning in to the trash can.  wish we could see his face a bit more...<br/>nice capture.</td>', 'go squirrel, go!cute image of the squirrel leaning in to the trash can.  wish we could see his face a bit more...nice capture.', '2005-11-10 18:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856078, 253320, 37875, '<td valign="top">cool cool cool!  like the closeup shot on the texture of the bone, as well as the dof.</td>', 'cool cool cool!  like the closeup shot on the texture of the bone, as well as the dof.', '2005-11-10 18:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856079, 255276, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the handwriting being visible instead of choosing a computer printout to tear up.  like the color treatment.</td>', 'like the handwriting being visible instead of choosing a computer printout to tear up.  like the color treatment.', '2005-11-10 18:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856081, 255399, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a cool idea.  like the pictures going in the trash...but i''d like to see this with different lighting (i think because of the carpet being so pale as a background.)</td>', 'what a cool idea.  like the pictures going in the trash...but i''d like to see this with different lighting (i think because of the carpet being so pale as a background.)', '2005-11-10 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856083, 254468, 37875, '<td valign="top">this brought a big grin to my face!  great idea!  the texture of the paper makes it difficult to focus on the text in Scooter''s letter...makes it feel a bit out of focus, so that would be my one criticism.</td>', 'this brought a big grin to my face!  great idea!  the texture of the paper makes it difficult to focus on the text in Scooter''s letter...makes it feel a bit out of focus, so that would be my one criticism.', '2005-11-10 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856085, 255161, 37875, '<td valign="top">LOVELY photo!  nice lighting on subject, and motion capture.  this would have been very cool to shoot at f2.8 or so, to blur the background a bit and focus on the sweeping figure.</td>', 'LOVELY photo!  nice lighting on subject, and motion capture.  this would have been very cool to shoot at f2.8 or so, to blur the background a bit and focus on the sweeping figure.', '2005-11-10 18:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856086, 255598, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the colors in the garbage items.  nice framing of the definition.</td>', 'like the colors in the garbage items.  nice framing of the definition.', '2005-11-10 18:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856087, 254814, 37875, '<td valign="top">lovely color treatment for this photo.  like the composition.</td>', 'lovely color treatment for this photo.  like the composition.', '2005-11-10 18:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856088, 254607, 37875, '<td valign="top">love it.  really like the color treatment, and like how those two cars just pop out.</td>', 'love it.  really like the color treatment, and like how those two cars just pop out.', '2005-11-10 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856089, 255231, 37875, '<td valign="top">interesting photo.  the sky''s a  bit overly-bright to my eye, which distracts.  love the expression on your subject''s face!  the person looks so clean for living in the garbage...</td>', 'interesting photo.  the sky''s a  bit overly-bright to my eye, which distracts.  love the expression on your subject''s face!  the person looks so clean for living in the garbage...', '2005-11-10 18:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856090, 253420, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice ir effect.  like the dof and shards of old bag caught on the fence.  nicely done.</td>', 'nice ir effect.  like the dof and shards of old bag caught on the fence.  nicely done.', '2005-11-10 18:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856091, 253764, 37875, '<td valign="top">the pov makes me feel like i''m spying on that poor trash can...<br/>cute idea.</td>', 'the pov makes me feel like i''m spying on that poor trash can...cute idea.', '2005-11-10 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856092, 254153, 37875, '<td valign="top">neat composition!  like the colors in the oven pans in contrast to all the woodsy organic tones.  visually interesting.</td>', 'neat composition!  like the colors in the oven pans in contrast to all the woodsy organic tones.  visually interesting.', '2005-11-10 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856093, 255447, 37875, '<td valign="top">lovely composition and tones to this shot.  like the light lines in the fence.</td>', 'lovely composition and tones to this shot.  like the light lines in the fence.', '2005-11-10 18:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
