(1856096, 255157, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a cool car.  the processing feels a wee bit harsh in its brightness, but i like this image very much.  nicely composed.</td>', 'what a cool car.  the processing feels a wee bit harsh in its brightness, but i like this image very much.  nicely composed.', '2005-11-10 18:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
