(1857610, 252866, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty sharp photo, good job on the focus.  A couple of blown highlights on the bowl though but nothing that is really bothering me.  Like this shot, the muted colours work well, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Pretty sharp photo, good job on the focus.  A couple of blown highlights on the bowl though but nothing that is really bothering me.  Like this shot, the muted colours work well, gave it a 7.', '2005-11-11 07:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857617, 252962, 27482, '<td valign="top">I´m not fond at all of the whole idea of a grave being garbage and frankly I deducted 1 point for being in a gray area about meeting the challenge.  Also, the shot itself is very "snapshot like", just looks like you stood there and snapped away, not really trying to find an interesting angle at this grave at all.  On the plus side it´s exposed well even though I would personally have exposed it a little bit less to make it more dark and mysterious.  Ended up giving it a 3.</td>', 'I´m not fond at all of the whole idea of a grave being garbage and frankly I deducted 1 point for being in a gray area about meeting the challenge.  Also, the shot itself is very "snapshot like", just looks like you stood there and snapped away, not really trying to find an interesting angle at this grave at all.  On the plus side it´s exposed well even though I would personally have exposed it a little bit less to make it more dark and mysterious.  Ended up giving it a 3.', '2005-11-11 07:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857626, 255537, 27482, '<td valign="top">This might be a double post, somehow my original message got screwed up by my web browser.<br/> <br/>There is something very odd about this picture, looks like a painting and not a photograph, did you use some kind of filter to achieve this or just too much contrast?  To be honest I don´t like it but don´t think it´s awful either, just not my cup of tea so I gave it a 5.  Meets the challenge though, that is certain.</td>', 'This might be a double post, somehow my original message got screwed up by my web browser. There is something very odd about this picture, looks like a painting and not a photograph, did you use some kind of filter to achieve this or just too much contrast?  To be honest I don´t like it but don´t think it´s awful either, just not my cup of tea so I gave it a 5.  Meets the challenge though, that is certain.', '2005-11-11 07:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857637, 255564, 34192, '<td valign="top">Simple.  Beautiful.  Wish you could have cloned out the lights in the background.  I like the skewed horizon line.  Think it adds to the mood. 9</td>', 'Simple.  Beautiful.  Wish you could have cloned out the lights in the background.  I like the skewed horizon line.  Think it adds to the mood. 9', '2005-11-11 08:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
