(1857643, 255490, 34192, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp. Very well done.  Not the most exciting image but technically sound. 9</td>', 'Clean, crisp. Very well done.  Not the most exciting image but technically sound. 9', '2005-11-11 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857649, 255441, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this skewed view of a still life.  Reflective bowl excellent choice.  I think people often don''t think about the entirety of a composition, make sure all elements add to the overall ''picture.''  You have done that here.  Well done. 9</td>', 'I love this skewed view of a still life.  Reflective bowl excellent choice.  I think people often don''t think about the entirety of a composition, make sure all elements add to the overall ''picture.''  You have done that here.  Well done. 9', '2005-11-11 08:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857655, 254617, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is bizarre in that I have no idea what it is but at the same time it is oddly moving.  I think the smooth stillness of the reflective water plays well against the chaos of the about to tumble down boxes.  The two contrasting elements play well together and force me to watch and wait.  I know it will never happen but just maybe...  The tones are absolutely beautiful.  Frame a little large for my tastes. 9</td>', 'This is bizarre in that I have no idea what it is but at the same time it is oddly moving.  I think the smooth stillness of the reflective water plays well against the chaos of the about to tumble down boxes.  The two contrasting elements play well together and force me to watch and wait.  I know it will never happen but just maybe...  The tones are absolutely beautiful.  Frame a little large for my tastes. 9', '2005-11-11 08:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857657, 254108, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very fluid.  The spot in the back doesn''t add and I''m pretty sure you would clone it out... Love the composition and the tones.  Colors are excellent - don''t think it would work as well in black and white.  Well done - 9</td>', 'Very fluid.  The spot in the back doesn''t add and I''m pretty sure you would clone it out... Love the composition and the tones.  Colors are excellent - don''t think it would work as well in black and white.  Well done - 9', '2005-11-11 08:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
