(1858119, 255519, 44172, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites in this challenge and certainly my favorite car image, really like the use of desat - the overall quality is excellent, nice layout or crop, meets challenge well, real good work :)</td>', 'one of my favorites in this challenge and certainly my favorite car image, really like the use of desat - the overall quality is excellent, nice layout or crop, meets challenge well, real good work :)', '2005-11-11 12:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
