(1862101, 254565, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your photo is actually the top half with the sky reflection. The golf ball itself looks a bit overly sharpened on my screen, but nice to see a different take on the challenge.</td>', 'My favorite part of your photo is actually the top half with the sky reflection. The golf ball itself looks a bit overly sharpened on my screen, but nice to see a different take on the challenge.', '2005-11-13 12:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862103, 254010, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title and photo make quite the commentary. Actually, it makes me feel bad for the woman you are calling garbage. I''m not crazy about the overall yellow colors from the lighting and the small shadow in the lower right corner is a bit distracting for me, but that''s just me. :-)</td>', 'Your title and photo make quite the commentary. Actually, it makes me feel bad for the woman you are calling garbage. I''m not crazy about the overall yellow colors from the lighting and the small shadow in the lower right corner is a bit distracting for me, but that''s just me. :-)', '2005-11-13 12:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862105, 254610, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s taken me a moment or two to try and figure out what your textured garbage is. Looks kind of like a gauze bandage or something similar. I like the highlights, but I wish there was just a bit more contrast to help with the overall texture of your subject matter.</td>', 'It''s taken me a moment or two to try and figure out what your textured garbage is. Looks kind of like a gauze bandage or something similar. I like the highlights, but I wish there was just a bit more contrast to help with the overall texture of your subject matter.', '2005-11-13 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862110, 255465, 36060, '<td valign="top">This one caught my eye, great shot.</td>', 'This one caught my eye, great shot.', '2005-11-13 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862113, 254752, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at your photo for a few minutes now. I''m trying to figure out just what the recreation garbage is. Honestly, to me, it looks like some early winter frost or snow. It''s not a bad shot, I just don''t see what you saw when you took the photo.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at your photo for a few minutes now. I''m trying to figure out just what the recreation garbage is. Honestly, to me, it looks like some early winter frost or snow. It''s not a bad shot, I just don''t see what you saw when you took the photo.', '2005-11-13 12:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862114, 253084, 36060, '<td valign="top">This one caught my eye, very nice.</td>', 'This one caught my eye, very nice.', '2005-11-13 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862115, 254797, 24991, '<td valign="top">I''m not liking the noise that (I assume) you added to this picture--overboard in my opinion.</td>', 'I''m not liking the noise that (I assume) you added to this picture--overboard in my opinion.', '2005-11-13 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862118, 255179, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very simple and clean image.</td>', 'Very simple and clean image.', '2005-11-13 12:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862119, 255603, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a cutie of a dog! For me, it doesn''t say garbage as well as other entries, but maybe because I love animals so much and this one really does look sweet. I like the white in the background as it helps move my eyes from the dog to the back of your photo.</td>', 'What a cutie of a dog! For me, it doesn''t say garbage as well as other entries, but maybe because I love animals so much and this one really does look sweet. I like the white in the background as it helps move my eyes from the dog to the back of your photo.', '2005-11-13 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862122, 255518, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat mailbox. The newspaper box is so bright that it really stands out, and my eyes keep getting drawn to that area and away from the rest of your photo.</td>', 'Neat mailbox. The newspaper box is so bright that it really stands out, and my eyes keep getting drawn to that area and away from the rest of your photo.', '2005-11-13 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862123, 255037, 24991, '<td valign="top">It seems too set-up to be true to your title in my opinion.</td>', 'It seems too set-up to be true to your title in my opinion.', '2005-11-13 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862128, 255262, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is by far my favorite garbage entry. I just love the bright colors, the composition, lighting...everything. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'This is by far my favorite garbage entry. I just love the bright colors, the composition, lighting...everything. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2005-11-13 12:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862129, 255309, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great idea and outcome.</td>', 'Great idea and outcome.', '2005-11-13 12:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862131, 252708, 24991, '<td valign="top">Something is strange about this picture--I think it''s either the focus( doubt this), the color (doubt this as well), or the quality saved at (think this is your problem).  It''s nice composition though, nice lighting, not bad.</td>', 'Something is strange about this picture--I think it''s either the focus( doubt this), the color (doubt this as well), or the quality saved at (think this is your problem).  It''s nice composition though, nice lighting, not bad.', '2005-11-13 13:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862137, 255397, 24991, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the overall saturation brought up a little more so there would be a strong contrast between the green bottle, and the autum leaves.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the overall saturation brought up a little more so there would be a strong contrast between the green bottle, and the autum leaves.', '2005-11-13 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862139, 254416, 24991, '<td valign="top">Nice!  It''s a shame that there is no doging/burning allowed under basic editing, would be perfect with a little burning in the sky.</td>', 'Nice!  It''s a shame that there is no doging/burning allowed under basic editing, would be perfect with a little burning in the sky.', '2005-11-13 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862141, 254108, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what re-bar is, but it''s a neat photo. I like the colors and composition.</td>', 'I don''t know what re-bar is, but it''s a neat photo. I like the colors and composition.', '2005-11-13 13:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862143, 255614, 24991, '<td valign="top">ewwww</td>', 'ewwww', '2005-11-13 13:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862145, 253764, 41675, '<td valign="top">While this fits in the garbage challenge, I wonder if a different angle or different cropping would work better. Compared with other entries, your subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as long.</td>', 'While this fits in the garbage challenge, I wonder if a different angle or different cropping would work better. Compared with other entries, your subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as long.', '2005-11-13 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862146, 253229, 24991, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!  Really pop the photo out IN YOUR FACE.  That''s a good thing.  :-)</td>', 'Nice colors!  Really pop the photo out IN YOUR FACE.  That''s a good thing.  :-)', '2005-11-13 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862148, 255518, 24991, '<td valign="top">Garbage...how?  I don''t understand.</td>', 'Garbage...how?  I don''t understand.', '2005-11-13 13:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862149, 254938, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your take on the challnge. Shows creative thinking. The background elements detract from your main subjects though. I also wish there was more focus on the foreground elements.</td>', 'I like your take on the challnge. Shows creative thinking. The background elements detract from your main subjects though. I also wish there was more focus on the foreground elements.', '2005-11-13 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862150, 255483, 24991, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Nice concept.</td>', 'LOL!  Nice concept.', '2005-11-13 13:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862152, 254902, 24991, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot.  I love your concept of it getting broken down into different parts, up to the end of the pencil, nice lighting, and excellent color.  9</td>', 'Sweet shot.  I love your concept of it getting broken down into different parts, up to the end of the pencil, nice lighting, and excellent color.  9', '2005-11-13 13:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862153, 253346, 36060, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo.</td>', 'I really do like this photo.', '2005-11-13 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862155, 254504, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the rose against the background colors - good choice. Your photo kind of gives me a sad feeling.</td>', 'I like the colors of the rose against the background colors - good choice. Your photo kind of gives me a sad feeling.', '2005-11-13 13:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862156, 253574, 36060, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo, great idea.</td>', 'I really do like this photo, great idea.', '2005-11-13 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862157, 253660, 36060, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo, great idea.</td>', 'I really do like this photo, great idea.', '2005-11-13 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862159, 254016, 41675, '<td valign="top">It looks like this little guy is trying to climb out of the garbage. Cute idea - clever. Unfortunately the flash and highlights are a bit overblown for my tastes and detract from your desired effect.</td>', 'It looks like this little guy is trying to climb out of the garbage. Cute idea - clever. Unfortunately the flash and highlights are a bit overblown for my tastes and detract from your desired effect.', '2005-11-13 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862161, 254814, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the still life setup and the tones you chose. Some of the white highlights are a bit too much for my tastes, but that''s just me.</td>', 'I like the still life setup and the tones you chose. Some of the white highlights are a bit too much for my tastes, but that''s just me.', '2005-11-13 13:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862164, 253103, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ya know, yours is the first photo where I can ALMOST smell the garbage itself. You captured that grimy, slimey look I associate with garbage.</td>', 'Ya know, yours is the first photo where I can ALMOST smell the garbage itself. You captured that grimy, slimey look I associate with garbage.', '2005-11-13 13:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862167, 255273, 24991, '<td valign="top">Stupid title in my opinion.  Still a well compsed shot.</td>', 'Stupid title in my opinion.  Still a well compsed shot.', '2005-11-13 13:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862171, 253841, 24991, '<td valign="top">mmmmm, candy.</td>', 'mmmmm, candy.', '2005-11-13 13:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862172, 254426, 41675, '<td valign="top">It took my eyes a moment to notice the lighthouse in the background. The boat in the foreground is such a strong element in your photo for me, that it overshadows what you''re trying to show.</td>', 'It took my eyes a moment to notice the lighthouse in the background. The boat in the foreground is such a strong element in your photo for me, that it overshadows what you''re trying to show.', '2005-11-13 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862174, 254587, 41675, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. Actually, I would like to see this rotated 90 degrees counterclockwise, and a bit faster shutter speed would lessen the blurriness of the paper balls. Both of those factors would make me score your photo higher.</td>', 'Creative idea. Actually, I would like to see this rotated 90 degrees counterclockwise, and a bit faster shutter speed would lessen the blurriness of the paper balls. Both of those factors would make me score your photo higher.', '2005-11-13 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862176, 254010, 24991, '<td valign="top">Harsh label...  What would she think if she saw this?</td>', 'Harsh label...  What would she think if she saw this?', '2005-11-13 13:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862177, 254797, 41675, '<td valign="top">Grain works well in your photo. I do find the pole and light area in the bottom right distracting though. I wonder how this would look with that completely cropped out. Either from the bottom or from the side.</td>', 'Grain works well in your photo. I do find the pole and light area in the bottom right distracting though. I wonder how this would look with that completely cropped out. Either from the bottom or from the side.', '2005-11-13 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862179, 255161, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for that darn truck in the background, I think this would be an even stronger image. I like the colors of the garmens and the blur of the broom.</td>', 'Had it not been for that darn truck in the background, I think this would be an even stronger image. I like the colors of the garmens and the blur of the broom.', '2005-11-13 13:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862180, 252962, 41675, '<td valign="top">Sad to see people have left garbage on a grave - very sad. For me, if you had cropped in more from the left and maybe not cropped off the top of the cross I would have scored this one point higher.</td>', 'Sad to see people have left garbage on a grave - very sad. For me, if you had cropped in more from the left and maybe not cropped off the top of the cross I would have scored this one point higher.', '2005-11-13 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862183, 253660, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and composition.</td>', 'I like the DOF and composition.', '2005-11-13 13:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862184, 255265, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, some of the highlights are a bit overdone, but I like your concept.</td>', 'To me, some of the highlights are a bit overdone, but I like your concept.', '2005-11-13 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862187, 254568, 24991, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like how you used a harsh light sourse to illuminate the buts--just very well done.  Would have liked a little more DOF, the blur in the foreground kinda distracts from the photo.</td>', 'Nice, I like how you used a harsh light sourse to illuminate the buts--just very well done.  Would have liked a little more DOF, the blur in the foreground kinda distracts from the photo.', '2005-11-13 13:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862188, 254158, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your shot. If it was a bit sharper, I would have scored it higher. It just seems a bit out of focus on my screen.</td>', 'I like your shot. If it was a bit sharper, I would have scored it higher. It just seems a bit out of focus on my screen.', '2005-11-13 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862189, 254693, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo shows creativity, but for me, I think the reds and yellows are a bit overdone, especially around her forearm and leg.</td>', 'Your photo shows creativity, but for me, I think the reds and yellows are a bit overdone, especially around her forearm and leg.', '2005-11-13 13:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862190, 252813, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting closeup. So close that without your title I wouldn''t know what it is. I like the textures though the reddish/orange is a bit strong for my tastes.</td>', 'Interesting closeup. So close that without your title I wouldn''t know what it is. I like the textures though the reddish/orange is a bit strong for my tastes.', '2005-11-13 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862192, 255303, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think you succeeded as I find the subject of your photo repulsive. They do look quite disgusting. Bit too much on the green and grainy side, but that''s just me.</td>', 'I think you succeeded as I find the subject of your photo repulsive. They do look quite disgusting. Bit too much on the green and grainy side, but that''s just me.', '2005-11-13 13:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862194, 252866, 24991, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t say garbage to me without the title.  Also, white balance seems tungsten or bad auto.  Cute squirrel though!</td>', 'This doesn''t say garbage to me without the title.  Also, white balance seems tungsten or bad auto.  Cute squirrel though!', '2005-11-13 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862197, 255053, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for the challenge. This is one job I personally would not want to do. For me, had the background been blurred out some it would have been better. That and not cutting off the top of his head.</td>', 'I like your idea for the challenge. This is one job I personally would not want to do. For me, had the background been blurred out some it would have been better. That and not cutting off the top of his head.', '2005-11-13 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862199, 255543, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo gives me gritty, inner-city feel.</td>', 'Your photo gives me gritty, inner-city feel.', '2005-11-13 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862201, 255031, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, had there been more contrast and not so monotoned, I would have scored this higher.</td>', 'For me, had there been more contrast and not so monotoned, I would have scored this higher.', '2005-11-13 13:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862204, 254538, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your photo is the water and tree reflection. I wonder how this would look if you cropped out a bit more from the bottom?</td>', 'My favorite part of your photo is the water and tree reflection. I wonder how this would look if you cropped out a bit more from the bottom?', '2005-11-13 13:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862207, 254218, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s not a bad shot, but for me, compared with others in the challenge, it doesn''t make me say "wow" or "oooh." I wonder how this would look with a bit more brightness or color saturation?</td>', 'It''s not a bad shot, but for me, compared with others in the challenge, it doesn''t make me say "wow" or "oooh." I wonder how this would look with a bit more brightness or color saturation?', '2005-11-13 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862211, 254607, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like the dream-like effect of the photo.  Makes it more interesting.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the dream-like effect of the photo.  Makes it more interesting.  Good luck.', '2005-11-13 13:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862212, 255491, 36832, '<td valign="top">Point well-taken.  Nice concept!  G''luck.</td>', 'Point well-taken.  Nice concept!  G''luck.', '2005-11-13 13:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862215, 253637, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like this perspective!  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this perspective!  Good luck.', '2005-11-13 13:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862216, 255286, 40464, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2005-11-13 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862245, 255552, 36832, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and colors.</td>', 'Nice comp and colors.', '2005-11-13 13:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862247, 255296, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve isolated the green to bring the can as the focus.  Nice. Good luck.</td>', 'I like how you''ve isolated the green to bring the can as the focus.  Nice. Good luck.', '2005-11-13 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862250, 254010, 36832, '<td valign="top">Did you take this at the corner of Main and Harrison because I think this is me all glammed up for my next film shoot!  :)  Very good concept and photo.  I think the main "critique" you''d have on this photo is that it could be sharper.  Works for me though! :)</td>', 'Did you take this at the corner of Main and Harrison because I think this is me all glammed up for my next film shoot!  :)  Very good concept and photo.  I think the main "critique" you''d have on this photo is that it could be sharper.  Works for me though! :)', '2005-11-13 14:04:17.000000', NULL, 1);
