(1865134, 253691, 36832, '<td valign="top">I''m having deja vue on this photo b/c I thought I''d already left a comment on it.  I stll like the colors the second time around.  If I had to really be critical--and this is being waaay overcritical--you may want to either sharpen the focus bc there first third side of the photo is slightly blurry OR (I think you were meaning to go for that effect) making it even more blurry so that the main focus is the area towards the center (e.g., bike or tires).  :)  Good luck.<br/> <br/>PS--That doesn''t sound harsh, right?  I don''t mean it to be.  :)</td>', 'I''m having deja vue on this photo b/c I thought I''d already left a comment on it.  I stll like the colors the second time around.  If I had to really be critical--and this is being waaay overcritical--you may want to either sharpen the focus bc there first third side of the photo is slightly blurry OR (I think you were meaning to go for that effect) making it even more blurry so that the main focus is the area towards the center (e.g., bike or tires).  :)  Good luck. PS--That doesn''t sound harsh, right?  I don''t mean it to be.  :)', '2005-11-14 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865141, 255179, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and crispness of focus.  I hope you recycled!  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the lighting and crispness of focus.  I hope you recycled!  :)  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865144, 254285, 36832, '<td valign="top">Your DOF is what makes this photo really interesting.  Nicely done.  Good luck.</td>', 'Your DOF is what makes this photo really interesting.  Nicely done.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865156, 254606, 36832, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo for a not-so-beautiful challenge subject.  The only thing that I notice is that the bar and wheel at the center could be sharper, but I''m not wearing my glasses so it may just be my eyes!  Overall, nicely done and I like the choice of border.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo for a not-so-beautiful challenge subject.  The only thing that I notice is that the bar and wheel at the center could be sharper, but I''m not wearing my glasses so it may just be my eyes!  Overall, nicely done and I like the choice of border.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865158, 254496, 36832, '<td valign="top">I really like your photo especially the texture of the dirty cups and cracks in the paint.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like your photo especially the texture of the dirty cups and cracks in the paint.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865161, 254841, 36832, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and I like your title.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very colorful and I like your title.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865165, 253229, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like how the colors jump right at you.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like how the colors jump right at you.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865166, 255483, 41047, '<td valign="top">haha.. nice one. i found it kind of naughty. 7.</td>', 'haha.. nice one. i found it kind of naughty. 7.', '2005-11-14 12:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865169, 255114, 41047, '<td valign="top">look at this guy :)) nice capture. 7.</td>', 'look at this guy :)) nice capture. 7.', '2005-11-14 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865170, 253582, 36832, '<td valign="top">It''s simple but pretty--like the texture.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s simple but pretty--like the texture.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865173, 254153, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice capture, this is quite humorous.</td>', 'nice capture, this is quite humorous.', '2005-11-14 12:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865176, 254004, 36832, '<td valign="top">This is totally unfair.  This garbage has a better view than I do from my house!  :)  This looks almost romantic.  :)  Beautiful sunset.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is totally unfair.  This garbage has a better view than I do from my house!  :)  This looks almost romantic.  :)  Beautiful sunset.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 13:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865179, 254164, 36832, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you included the ashes.  Cigs are disgusting and dirty and this truly conveys that.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m glad you included the ashes.  Cigs are disgusting and dirty and this truly conveys that.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 13:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865181, 255543, 41047, '<td valign="top">this has quite a dramatic feeling, i think b&amp;w adds to it. nice composition, 7.</td>', 'this has quite a dramatic feeling, i think b&w adds to it. nice composition, 7.', '2005-11-14 13:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865185, 255228, 36832, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you didn''t try to beautify this photo bc garbage just isn''t beautiful (in most cases).  Only thing to change may be the lighting/exposure.  Photo could use a bit of lighting.  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m glad you didn''t try to beautify this photo bc garbage just isn''t beautiful (in most cases).  Only thing to change may be the lighting/exposure.  Photo could use a bit of lighting.  :)  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 13:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865191, 255453, 36832, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo.  It conveys a feeling of loss and sadness.  Or, I could just be talking out of my ***.  :)  Anyway, like the colors and subject.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this is a great photo.  It conveys a feeling of loss and sadness.  Or, I could just be talking out of my ***.  :)  Anyway, like the colors and subject.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 13:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865200, 254903, 36832, '<td valign="top">I think you have really good lighting here.  It may even be a good entry for the upcoming challenge.  ;)  Just a thought.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think you have really good lighting here.  It may even be a good entry for the upcoming challenge.  ;)  Just a thought.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 13:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865206, 255493, 36832, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a great photo in general, but you may want to redo it without the finger prints.  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this would be a great photo in general, but you may want to redo it without the finger prints.  :)  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 13:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865346, 255626, 36832, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely peeled and photographed banana.  The photo quality itself is clean and crisp.  Nice job.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a nicely peeled and photographed banana.  The photo quality itself is clean and crisp.  Nice job.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 14:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865348, 253660, 36832, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo with originality.  I like the focus and photographing it (the cork) with the bottle and glasses in the background is a nice touch.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo with originality.  I like the focus and photographing it (the cork) with the bottle and glasses in the background is a nice touch.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 14:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865353, 255592, 36832, '<td valign="top">Like the photo and it''s a nice b&amp;w.  Wondering what it looks like in color.  The background of the photo looks like it may be colorful and if so, it may make a more dramatic point to see a colorful background and a not-so-lively plant (though it looks healthy as a b&amp;w).  :)  Nicely done though.  Good luck.</td>', 'Like the photo and it''s a nice b&w.  Wondering what it looks like in color.  The background of the photo looks like it may be colorful and if so, it may make a more dramatic point to see a colorful background and a not-so-lively plant (though it looks healthy as a b&w).  :)  Nicely done though.  Good luck.', '2005-11-14 14:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865355, 255519, 41047, '<td valign="top">i think the wide angle works well in this shot. nice composition, the faded and unsaturated colours give a nice feeling of old and forgotton. 8.</td>', 'i think the wide angle works well in this shot. nice composition, the faded and unsaturated colours give a nice feeling of old and forgotton. 8.', '2005-11-14 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865514, 255226, 208, '<td valign="top">The clutter is great, but I don''t think the added grain adds to the photo. I do like the muted tones, though.</td>', 'The clutter is great, but I don''t think the added grain adds to the photo. I do like the muted tones, though.', '2005-11-14 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865520, 254784, 208, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you played around so much with the colors. I guess blue isn''t as "loud" as red, but then you desaturated pretty much everything else. I bet straight b&amp;w would have been a better choice.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you played around so much with the colors. I guess blue isn''t as "loud" as red, but then you desaturated pretty much everything else. I bet straight b&w would have been a better choice.', '2005-11-14 15:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865532, 255499, 208, '<td valign="top">It might be a little too dark, but the sepia is a great choice here.</td>', 'It might be a little too dark, but the sepia is a great choice here.', '2005-11-14 15:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865631, 255207, 41047, '<td valign="top">the focus and sharpness is great in this picture. i liked the contrast of bacground blue to light brown of onion skin. real nice capture, 8.</td>', 'the focus and sharpness is great in this picture. i liked the contrast of bacground blue to light brown of onion skin. real nice capture, 8.', '2005-11-14 15:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865640, 255270, 41047, '<td valign="top">funny one.. nice DOF. 7.</td>', 'funny one.. nice DOF. 7.', '2005-11-14 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865685, 255231, 19670, '<td valign="top">Might have been better to compose the shot without the sky, which is overexposed.</td>', 'Might have been better to compose the shot without the sky, which is overexposed.', '2005-11-14 15:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1865702, 254219, 37320, '<td valign="top">Thats why I drink out of glass, recycle baby yeah!  BTW this shot is awesome and I like the use of both reflections and B and W.  This could be an awareness ad.</td>', 'Thats why I drink out of glass, recycle baby yeah!  BTW this shot is awesome and I like the use of both reflections and B and W.  This could be an awareness ad.', '2005-11-14 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
