(1866684, 252962, 39919, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I would call this garbage, it looks like somebody went to a lot of trouble and did the best with what they had available.  I have a hard time calling what looks to me like a shrine, garbage.</td>', 'I am not sure I would call this garbage, it looks like somebody went to a lot of trouble and did the best with what they had available.  I have a hard time calling what looks to me like a shrine, garbage.', '2005-11-14 21:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
