(1867102, 255268, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good shot and well balanced color.  I wish the critter could be in a little better focus. But nice job.</td>', 'Good shot and well balanced color.  I wish the critter could be in a little better focus. But nice job.', '2005-11-14 23:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
