(1867114, 253314, 33400, '<td valign="top">Quite the attention grabber.  This tugs at the heart-strings and is well set. A little too bright, but perhaps that was intentional.  Good job.</td>', 'Quite the attention grabber.  This tugs at the heart-strings and is well set. A little too bright, but perhaps that was intentional.  Good job.', '2005-11-14 23:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
