(1867578, 253637, 47365, '<td valign="top">great idea.  for some reason though, the picture doesn''t feel dramatic enough to me.  maybe the person isn''t close enough?  i''m not sure what else i''d want, it just doesn''t quite feel exciting enough to me.</td>', 'great idea.  for some reason though, the picture doesn''t feel dramatic enough to me.  maybe the person isn''t close enough?  i''m not sure what else i''d want, it just doesn''t quite feel exciting enough to me.', '2005-11-15 07:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867595, 255491, 41999, '<td valign="top">Although I agree with the sentiment, this challenge is about the image, not a pun title. That said, the orientation of the pack serves to draw the viewer into the picture. The cropping, however, is problematic: the shadow on the left should not have been cut off, and it might have been better if the package had not been truncated at the top. Overall, the image is muddy...no real blacks or whites...trypunching it up by  adjusting with ''levels'' in Photoshop (or, better, with ''curves'').</td>', 'Although I agree with the sentiment, this challenge is about the image, not a pun title. That said, the orientation of the pack serves to draw the viewer into the picture. The cropping, however, is problematic: the shadow on the left should not have been cut off, and it might have been better if the package had not been truncated at the top. Overall, the image is muddy...no real blacks or whites...trypunching it up by  adjusting with ''levels'' in Photoshop (or, better, with ''curves'').', '2005-11-15 07:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867605, 255161, 41999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I really like the composition, the motion blur of the broom and foot, and the bright color in an otherwise rather high key image.  10</td>', 'Beautiful! I really like the composition, the motion blur of the broom and foot, and the bright color in an otherwise rather high key image.  10', '2005-11-15 07:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
