(1870672, 254904, 44490, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the image in the droplet.  Did you try to have the needle closer so that the droplet would be larger?  Nice idea, especially if you could get (more) of the assignment into the image, like having the biohazard image on the biohazard disposal container.</td>', 'I almost missed the image in the droplet.  Did you try to have the needle closer so that the droplet would be larger?  Nice idea, especially if you could get (more) of the assignment into the image, like having the biohazard image on the biohazard disposal container.', '2005-11-15 23:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
