(1870696, 255553, 36832, '<td valign="top">First of all, I have to disagree.  Alcohol is never trash!  :P<br/>I like the angle that this photo is taken...slightly tilted.  It''s really very interesting--looks almost like a commercial/advertisement photo.  Nice job.  Good luck.</td>', 'First of all, I have to disagree.  Alcohol is never trash!  :PI like the angle that this photo is taken...slightly tilted.  It''s really very interesting--looks almost like a commercial/advertisement photo.  Nice job.  Good luck.', '2005-11-15 23:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870712, 255231, 44490, '<td valign="top">Or maybe more like, "Earning my allowance..."  :-)  Somewhat overexposed and washed out, how about additional lighting on the subject so you can get a better exposure on the rest.</td>', 'Or maybe more like, "Earning my allowance..."  :-)  Somewhat overexposed and washed out, how about additional lighting on the subject so you can get a better exposure on the rest.', '2005-11-15 23:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870741, 255552, 44490, '<td valign="top">The person is distracting, and distractingly underexposed.  It would probably work better with more exposure of the person, or something inanimate there - as is, it''s kind of in the "something''s there, but not there enough" category</td>', 'The person is distracting, and distractingly underexposed.  It would probably work better with more exposure of the person, or something inanimate there - as is, it''s kind of in the "something''s there, but not there enough" category', '2005-11-15 23:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
