(1870872, 255603, 47117, '<td valign="top">WOW, what a WIDE range of scores here!  Ok, let me EXPLAIN this to others.  The dog''s name is not Garbage. LOL...I nearly split a gut when I read those comments because the actual garbage is taking up over 1/4 of the photo. The "garbage" is the old box spring he is laying on.  <br/> <br/>Since this question was asked several times, I guess this angle was not the best. I thought everyone would be able to easily see this is a box spring, outside, since you can see grass and weeds around it.  Obviously no normally clean person just lies their box spring outside.  I never dreamed some would not see the garbage in this photo.<br/> <br/>I was riding the neighborhood and really was just taking pics of this dog. When he laid on the box spring I took a few shots, but at the time I really thought the box spring took away from the shot. When I realized it was actual "garbage" and good for this contest, and in the time frame, I decided it was not just garbage but it would be cute with the dog in it.  <br/> <br/>Sorry some of you had trouble.  Getting a couple of 10''s and a 9, and a wide range of votes above average was a nice surprise.  It amazes me how about 1/2 got it and 1/2 did not. :)  <br/> <br/>Thanks for voting!  I just wish more got it than 1/2.<br/> <br/>Rose</td>', 'WOW, what a WIDE range of scores here!  Ok, let me EXPLAIN this to others.  The dog''s name is not Garbage. LOL...I nearly split a gut when I read those comments because the actual garbage is taking up over 1/4 of the photo. The "garbage" is the old box spring he is laying on.   Since this question was asked several times, I guess this angle was not the best. I thought everyone would be able to easily see this is a box spring, outside, since you can see grass and weeds around it.  Obviously no normally clean person just lies their box spring outside.  I never dreamed some would not see the garbage in this photo. I was riding the neighborhood and really was just taking pics of this dog. When he laid on the box spring I took a few shots, but at the time I really thought the box spring took away from the shot. When I realized it was actual "garbage" and good for this contest, and in the time frame, I decided it was not just garbage but it would be cute with the dog in it.   Sorry some of you had trouble.  Getting a couple of 10''s and a 9, and a wide range of votes above average was a nice surprise.  It amazes me how about 1/2 got it and 1/2 did not. :)   Thanks for voting!  I just wish more got it than 1/2. Rose', '2005-11-16 00:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1870873, 254903, 17554, '<td valign="top">Ok, I think many missed some stuff in this shot. First of all...all the bottles are Not full..the one in the middle is crumpled and empty (should have made it more obvious).  Anyhow, I guess I was too subtle in my statement of trying to personify all the full bottles standing around (and  away from) the empty, crumpled ''trash'' as a slight comment on society.  Anyhow, just learning the ropes, thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Ok, I think many missed some stuff in this shot. First of all...all the bottles are Not full..the one in the middle is crumpled and empty (should have made it more obvious).  Anyhow, I guess I was too subtle in my statement of trying to personify all the full bottles standing around (and  away from) the empty, crumpled ''trash'' as a slight comment on society.  Anyhow, just learning the ropes, thanks for the comments.', '2005-11-16 00:18:08.000000', NULL, 0),
