(1899860, 253601, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot and definately fits the challenge.  I agree it would probably look a little better in black and white.  For fun it would be interesting to see what it would look like with some added noise.  I would also suggest cropping off a little on the right to make the fence(?) less centered.</td>', 'Very interesting shot and definately fits the challenge.  I agree it would probably look a little better in black and white.  For fun it would be interesting to see what it would look like with some added noise.  I would also suggest cropping off a little on the right to make the fence(?) less centered.', '2005-11-27 11:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
