(1920592, 255043, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images you come back to and like more each time.  I hate to say, in original voting I gave this a 6.  Today I would give it an 8 or 9.  I get both a sense of futility and hope. And dedication.  Oh so dedicated.  The toning is excellent, composition well done.</td>', 'This is one of those images you come back to and like more each time.  I hate to say, in original voting I gave this a 6.  Today I would give it an 8 or 9.  I get both a sense of futility and hope. And dedication.  Oh so dedicated.  The toning is excellent, composition well done.', '2005-12-04 08:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
