(1939880, 255617, 14614, '<td valign="top">Simple elements with limited color pallette shows your artistic eye - oddly the words (that sometime dominate a photo) are only elements here and work to create the effect (and tie to the challenge theme).  I am always drawn to the simple and geometric - well done here.</td>', 'Simple elements with limited color pallette shows your artistic eye - oddly the words (that sometime dominate a photo) are only elements here and work to create the effect (and tie to the challenge theme).  I am always drawn to the simple and geometric - well done here.', '2005-12-10 06:59:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943915, 254609, 44597, '<td valign="top">Poor mandrade really needs to get over himself.   The photographer is an Aussie and we are one of the Yanks greatest allies.  Don''t forget it is a very dirty Aussie bin, maybe he should have found a foreign bin and use it, or, is he making a ''dirty comment'' about Oz?   Wake up and look at the photo, look at the colours and use your imagination in lieu of your paranoia!</td>', 'Poor mandrade really needs to get over himself.   The photographer is an Aussie and we are one of the Yanks greatest allies.  Don''t forget it is a very dirty Aussie bin, maybe he should have found a foreign bin and use it, or, is he making a ''dirty comment'' about Oz?   Wake up and look at the photo, look at the colours and use your imagination in lieu of your paranoia!', '2005-12-12 05:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
